### The other direction, and it needs its own entity: `customers` declares no `audit`, so it keeps no
### `updated_at`, so there is no version to tag. Both halves matter — an entity that always tags and
### an entity that never can — and one entity could not show both.
# @name ReadUnversioned
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
GET {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/customers/{{CustomerBorovicaId}}
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}

### An unconditional write is fine
# @name UnconditionalWrite
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
PATCH {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/customers/{{CustomerBorovicaId}}
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tier": "priority" }

### An If-Match naming a version is REFUSED rather than ignored: a 200 would tell the caller their
### condition held, when nothing was compared and a concurrent writer was overwritten.
# @name IfMatchOnUnversioned
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [412]
PATCH {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/customers/{{CustomerBorovicaId}}
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
If-Match: "639212702445441920"
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tier": "standard" }

### `If-Match: *` is the one precondition this entity CAN answer — it asks only that the row exist
# @name IfMatchAnyOnUnversioned
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
PATCH {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/customers/{{CustomerBorovicaId}}
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
If-Match: *
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Upgraded to the priority tier." }

### `If-None-Match` is refused on every write, versioned or not: this API compares a row against the
### version a caller HOLDS and has no channel for "act only if the row is not at this version".
# @name IfNoneMatchOnWrite
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [412]
PATCH {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/customers/{{CustomerBorovicaId}}
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
If-None-Match: *
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tier": "standard" }

### The end state: the two accepted writes landed and the two refusals did not
# @name FinalUnversionedState
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
GET {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/customers/{{CustomerBorovicaId}}
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
